      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LAKEVIEW LIBBY (4) hasn't been far away here at the last two, finding the frame both times, most recently when third beaten 0.8 lengths (35.28). Has a win and 11 places times at this track. Makes plenty of appeal. ZIPPING DARGAN (6) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (25.92) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Rockhampton. Solid beginner and with a good start can clear the tricky draw. Expected to do much better this time. GO WHISKEY GO (2) turned in a plain run last time when sixth at Q Straight over 350m behind Super League (19.47) in a Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Can measure up this time. VITESSE ETOILE (1) is worth consideration after filling a hole last start.",
